   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Units"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 120,
   "id": "3b891259",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from astropy.constants import G\n",
    "from astropy.units import km, au, pc, kpc, s, yr, Myr, Gyr, Msun, rad, kg, J, m"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 121,
   "id": "3bffb806",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$4.4985022 \\times 10^{-6} \\; \\mathrm{\\frac{kpc^{3}}{M_{\\odot}\\,Gyr^{2}}}$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "<Quantity 4.49850215e-06 kpc3 / (solMass Gyr2)>"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 121,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "G = G.to('kpc3/(Msun*Gyr2)')\n",
    "G"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f9c29e1e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Predefined the characteristic unit scales according to the dataset according to [TNG unit system](https://www.tng-project.org/data/docs/specifications/#parttype1).\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 122,
   "id": "cb77fffa",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "L_u = kpc/h #length unit\n",
    "V_u = (km/s)*np.sqrt(a) #spatial velocity unit\n",
    "Phi_u = V_u**2 #potential unit\n",
    "M_u = 10e10*Msun/h #dark mass unit"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 123,
   "id": "496342fb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#L_u, V_u, Phi_u, M_u"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 126,
   "id": "9d350315",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "xyz = np.array(data['PartType1']['Coordinates'][:])*L_u #coordinate in co-moving distance\n",
    "phi = np.array(data['PartType1']['Potential'][:])*Phi_u\n",
    "vxyz = np.array(data['PartType1']['Velocities'][:])*V_u\n",
    "mass_dm = mass_darkm*M_u\n",
    "M = N_dm_particles*mass_dm\n",
    "#print(xyz.shape), print(phi.shape), print(vxyz.shape)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 127,
   "id": "4f812b5e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "xyz *= a #conversion to physical distance\n",
    "# Mean of the velocites and positions coordinates\n",
    "vxyz_mean = np.mean(vxyz, axis=0)\n",
    "xyz_mean = np.mean(xyz, axis=0)\n",
    "#print(vxyz_mean), print(xyz_mean)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "53b4c408",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Data standardization: here all velocities and positions coordinates are centered around theire mean value."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 128,
   "id": "da6f53f4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "xyz -= xyz_mean\n",
    "#vxyz -= vxyz_mean"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "20946de7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The potential $\\phi$ is the potential at each particle coordinate due to all other particles in the simulation box, i.e, $\n",
    "\\Phi(\\mathbf{x}) = -G \\sum_{i \\neq j} \\frac{m_j}{|\\mathbf{x} - \\mathbf{x}_j|}$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 129,
   "id": "60731d0f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#distances\n",
    "r = np.linalg.norm(xyz, axis=1)\n",
    "x, y, z = xyz[:,0], xyz[:,1], xyz[:,2]\n",
    "R = np.sqrt(x**2 + y**2)\n",
    "\n",
    "#velocities\n",
    "vx, vy, vz = vxyz[:,0], vxyz[:,1], vxyz[:,2]\n",
    "v = np.linalg.norm(vxyz, axis=1)"
   ]
  },
