  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e3757099",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Quantitative analysis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "892d68d6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Energy of such a system\n",
    "\\begin{equation}\n",
    "E = \\frac{1}{2} m v^2(r) + m \\Phi(r) \\quad (4.3)\n",
    "\\end{equation}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "id": "6ee1460f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "E = 1/2*mass_dm*v**2 + mass_dm*phi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 19,
   "id": "c205dd8e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#E.shape, r.shape, "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "id": "76bf0984",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
